  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    if not grid or not grid[0]:\n        return [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find all positions with value 8\n    eight_positions = []\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] == 8:\n                eight_positions.append((r, c))\n    \n    # If no 8s found, return copy of original grid\n    if not eight_positions:\n        return [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # Find bounding box of 8s\n    min_row = min(r for r, c in eight_positions)\n    max_row = max(r for r, c in eight_positions)\n    min_col = min(c for r, c in eight_positions)\n    max_col = max(c for r, c in eight_positions)\n    \n    # Create output grid\n    output = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # Replace 1s with 3s inside the bounding box\n    for r in range(min_row, max_row + 1):\n        for c in range(min_col, max_col + 1):\n            if output[r][c] == 1:\n                output[r][c] = 3\n    \n    return output\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    if not grid or not grid[0]:\n        return [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find all positions with value 8\n    eight_positions = []\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] == 8:\n                eight_positions.append((r, c))\n    \n    # If no 8s found, return copy of original grid\n    if not eight_positions:\n        return [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # Find bounding box of 8s\n    min_row = min(r for r, c in eight_positions)\n    max_row = max(r for r, c in eight_positions)\n    min_col = min(c for r, c in eight_positions)\n    max_col = max(c for r, c in eight_positions)\n    \n    # Create output grid\n    output = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # Replace 1s with 3s inside the bounding box\n    for r in range(min_row, max_row + 1):\n        for c in range(min_col, max_col + 1):\n            if output[r][c] == 1:\n                output[r][c] = 3\n    \n    return output",
